### Demo de venta de material — flujo end-to-end
### Requiere la extensión REST Client (VS Code) o IntelliJ HTTP Client.
### Orden: login -> cliente -> (categoría) -> material -> stock -> venta -> consultas.
### Ejecutar de arriba hacia abajo; las variables se capturan de cada respuesta.

@host = http://localhost:3000/api

### 1. Login (usuario sembrado)
# @name login
POST {{host}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@perlinor.local",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### 2. Crear cliente
# @name createCustomer
POST {{host}}/commercial/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Constructora SA",
  "taxId": "30123456789",
  "email": "compras@constructora.com",
  "phone": "381-5551234",
  "address": "Av. Siempre Viva 742"
}

###
@customerId = {{createCustomer.response.body.data.id}}

### 3. Listar categorías de producto terminado (usar una sembrada)
# @name categories
GET {{host}}/categories?type=FINISHED_PRODUCT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@categoryId = {{categories.response.body.data.0.id}}

### 3b. (Opcional) Crear una categoría nueva
POST {{host}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Cemento y áridos",
  "type": "FINISHED_PRODUCT"
}

### 4. Crear material (nace con currentStock = 0)
# @name createProduct
POST {{host}}/inventory/finished-products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "CEM-50",
  "name": "Cemento Portland 50kg",
  "categoryId": "{{categoryId}}",
  "unit": "BOLSA",
  "salePrice": 8500
}

###
@productId = {{createProduct.response.body.data.id}}

### 5. Cargar stock inicial (movimiento IN)
POST {{host}}/inventory/finished-products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "IN",
  "quantity": 100,
  "reference": "Stock inicial"
}

### 6. Registrar venta (descuenta stock, genera movimientos OUT)
# @name createSale
POST {{host}}/commercial/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "items": [
    { "finishedProductId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 5 }
  ]
}

###
@saleId = {{createSale.response.body.data.id}}

### 7a. Consultar la venta con su detalle
GET {{host}}/commercial/sales/{{saleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7b. Consultar el stock actualizado del material (debería ser 95)
GET {{host}}/inventory/finished-products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7c. Ver historial de movimientos del material (IN + OUT)
GET {{host}}/inventory/finished-products/{{productId}}/movements
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. (Negativo) Venta sin stock suficiente -> 422 y rollback total
POST {{host}}/commercial/sales
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "items": [
    { "finishedProductId": "{{productId}}", "quantity": 1000 }
  ]
}
